    "description": "Uses the reference collection variable names, default values, Bearer authentication, JSON bodies and pm.environment scripts. Select the SAME Postman environment for User and Admin. Run User first with Keep variable values enabled, then Admin. Configuration defaults (URL, TEST_PASSWORD, TEST_TEL, ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD) are copied to the selected environment only when missing or blank. Registration generates a fresh TEST_EMAIL. BOOKING_ID is booking A, BOOKING_ID_2 is booking B and BOOKING_ID_3 is booking C. Requires an existing admin and an active provider. The configured PROVIDER_ID is preferred if active; otherwise the first active provider is selected. Expected 400/401/404/409 responses have passing tests. Admin steps 9-12 edit and delete B; C remains."
